#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "arithmetic"
msgstr "arithmetic"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "This manual documents `arithmetic` **0.5.0**. Earlier release history lives in [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md)."
msgstr "本手册介绍 `arithmetic` **0.5.0**。更早的版本说明和仓库历史请参见 [CHANGELOG.md](../../CHANGELOG.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:6
msgid "Release focus"
msgstr "本版重点"

#: manual/index.md:8
msgid "`IntegralContextual` embeds MoonBit `Int` values and returns diagnostics."
msgstr "`IntegralContextual` 嵌入 MoonBit `Int` 并返回 diagnostics。"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "`AdjacentContextual` exposes next-plus, next-minus, and next-toward."
msgstr "`AdjacentContextual` 提供 next-plus、next-minus 和 next-toward。"

#: manual/index.md:10
msgid "`ConstantsContextual` and `HyperbolicContextual` define context-faithful capability boundaries for richer numeric backends."
msgstr "`ConstantsContextual` 与 `HyperbolicContextual` 为更丰富的数值后端定义忠实于 context 的能力边界。"

#: manual/index.md:12
msgid "Certification failures remain explicit through `ArithmeticError`."
msgstr "certification failure 继续通过 `ArithmeticError` 显式返回。"

#: manual/index.md:14
msgid "Capability layers"
msgstr "能力分层"

#: manual/index.md:16
msgid "Unchecked elementary traits expose direct backend behavior."
msgstr "unchecked elementary traits 直接保留后端行为。"

#: manual/index.md:17
msgid "Checked traits expose structured domain and division failures."
msgstr "checked traits 显式返回定义域错误和除法错误。"

#: manual/index.md:18
msgid "Contextual traits return a value plus diagnostics under an explicit `ArithmeticContext`."
msgstr "contextual traits 接收 `ArithmeticContext`，返回结果值及诊断信息。"

#: manual/index.md:20
msgid "Enclosure traits model containment and definite or possible relations."
msgstr "enclosure traits 表达包含、确定关系和可能关系。"

#: manual/index.md:22
msgid "Context contract"
msgstr "Context 契约"

#: manual/index.md:24
msgid "Precision is clamped to at least `1`."
msgstr "precision 下限为 `1`。"

#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "`e_min` must not exceed `e_max` when both are supplied."
msgstr "同时提供 `e_min` 与 `e_max` 时，`e_min` 不能大于 `e_max`。"

#: manual/index.md:26
msgid "Decimal presets define precision, exponent range, and clamping together."
msgstr "decimal 预设会一起确定 precision、指数范围与钳制开关。"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Diagnostics combine with logical OR and remain ordinary immutable values."
msgstr "诊断标志通过逻辑 OR 合并，始终作为普通不可变值传递。"

#: manual/index.md:29
msgid "Built-in instance limits"
msgstr "内置实例限制"

#: manual/index.md:31
msgid "The built-in `Float` and `Double` contextual operations preserve native scalar behavior. They do not apply arbitrary decimal precision, directed rounding, exponent clamping, or general status-flag detection. `Float` integer embedding reports detectable conversion loss; adjacent operations use the fixed IEEE binary format and return empty diagnostics because neighbor selection is exact. Contextual division and square root reuse the checked validation paths. Native `Float` and `Double` do not implement contextual constants or hyperbolic functions."
msgstr "内置 `Float` 与 `Double` contextual 操作保留原生标量语义，不执行任意 decimal 精度、定向舍入、指数钳制或通用状态标志探测。`Float` 的整数嵌入会报告可检测的转换损失；相邻值操作使用固定 IEEE 二进制格式，并因邻接选择在该表示集合中是精确操作而返回空 diagnostics。contextual 除法和平方根会复用 checked 路径完成验证。原生 `Float` 与 `Double` 不实现 contextual 常量或双曲函数。"

