#: manual/tutorial/core.md:1
msgid "Core tutorial"
msgstr "Core 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:3
msgid "Generic analytic helper"
msgstr "泛型解析辅助函数"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:11
msgid "This signature requests only the capabilities the algorithm uses."
msgstr "这个签名只声明算法真正使用的能力。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:13
msgid "Construct an arithmetic context"
msgstr "构造 Arithmetic Context"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:26
msgid "Use a preset when its decimal format matches the backend contract. Use `new` when a concrete backend supports a different working context."
msgstr "当后端契约与某个 decimal 格式一致时使用预设；当具体后端支持不同工作上下文时使用 `new`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:29
msgid "Contextual division"
msgstr "Contextual 除法"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:42
msgid "The built-in `Double` instance validates division through `DivChecked` and wraps a successful result with exact diagnostics. A decimal backend may use the same trait while producing rounding or clamping flags."
msgstr "内置 `Double` 实例通过 `DivChecked` 验证除法，并用 exact diagnostics 包装成功结果。 decimal 后端可以实现相同 trait，同时返回舍入或钳制标志。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:46
msgid "Combine diagnostics"
msgstr "合并 Diagnostics"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:53
msgid "Combining diagnostics is an explicit value transformation. It does not mutate either input or package-global state."
msgstr "合并 diagnostics 是显式的值转换，不会修改输入，也不会修改包级全局状态。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:56
msgid "Checked comparison"
msgstr "Checked 比较"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:67
msgid "Use the checked path when unordered values such as NaN must not be silently coerced into a total order."
msgstr "当 NaN 等无序值不能被静默折叠成总序时，应使用 checked 路径。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:70
msgid "Practical guidance"
msgstr "实践建议"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:72
msgid "Use unchecked traits when direct backend semantics are acceptable."
msgstr "接受直接后端语义时使用 unchecked traits。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:73
msgid "Use checked traits when failure must be explicit but diagnostics are not needed."
msgstr "需要显式失败但不需要诊断标志时使用 checked traits。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:75
msgid "Use contextual traits when an algorithm must pass working context and retain diagnostic flags."
msgstr "算法需要传递工作 context 并保留诊断标志时使用 contextual traits。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:77
msgid "Do not assume the built-in `Float` or `Double` contextual instances emulate decimal precision or directed rounding."
msgstr "不要假设内置 `Float` 或 `Double` contextual 实例会模拟 decimal precision 或定向舍入。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:79
msgid "Keep algebraic structure in `luna-generic`; use `arithmetic` for analytic and contextual capabilities."
msgstr "代数结构属于 `luna-generic`；解析和 contextual 能力属于 `arithmetic`。"

#: manual/verification.md:1
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: manual/verification.md:3
msgid "Local gate"
msgstr "本地门禁"

#: manual/verification.md:5
msgid "Run the same checks required before a release:"
msgstr "发布前运行同一组检查："

#: manual/verification.md:19
msgid "`moon info` regenerates public-interface snapshots. The following diff check requires the tracked `pkg.generated.mbti` file to agree with the source API."
msgstr "`moon info` 会生成 public-interface snapshot；随后 diff 检查保证已跟踪的 `pkg.generated.mbti` 与源 API 一致。"

#: manual/verification.md:22
msgid "What the tests establish"
msgstr "测试所能证明的内容"

#: manual/verification.md:24
msgid "The checked tests cover error classification and the public construction and inspection paths for certification failures. In particular, they establish that the detail survives `ArithmeticError::certification_failure`, that precision and refinement inputs are normalized, and that existing error predicates remain disjoint from `is_certification_failure`."
msgstr "checked tests 覆盖 certification failure 的分类、公开构造和检查路径：detail 经过 `ArithmeticError::certification_failure` 后仍被保留，precision/refinement 输入会规范化，且已有 error predicates 与 `is_certification_failure` 保持互斥。"

#: manual/verification.md:30
msgid "The contextual tests cover exact and rounded `Int` embedding, signed-zero direction, NaN propagation, stationary infinities, finite-to-infinity steps, and minimum-subnormal-to-zero steps for the fixed IEEE `Float` and `Double` formats. Test-local implementations also verify contextual hyperbolic outcomes and certification-failure propagation for constants."
msgstr "contextual tests 覆盖精确与发生舍入的 `Int` 嵌入、带符号零方向、NaN 传播、静止 infinity、有限值到 infinity 的步进，以及固定 IEEE `Float`/`Double` 格式中最小 subnormal 到零的步进。测试包内的实现还验证 contextual 双曲结果和常量认证失败传播。"

#: manual/verification.md:36
msgid "The tests do not claim that `Float` or `Double` perform certified arithmetic. They verify the shared capability vocabulary, fixed-format adjacent semantics, and ordinary error-model behavior."
msgstr "测试不声称 `Float` 或 `Double` 执行 certified arithmetic；它们只验证共享 capability vocabulary、固定格式的相邻值语义及其普通 error-model 行为。"

#: manual/verification.md:40
msgid "Release gate"
msgstr "发布门禁"

#: manual/verification.md:42
msgid "The `publish-package` GitHub workflow accepts an explicit release version and requires it to equal the version in `moon.mod`. It then updates the registry, builds and checks all targets, runs default, JavaScript, and native tests, publishes with the `LUNA_MOONCAKE` secret, and creates the corresponding GitHub release."
msgstr "`publish-package` GitHub workflow 接受显式 release version，并要求它与 `moon.mod` 相等。之后它更新 registry，构建并检查所有 target，运行 default/JavaScript/native tests，使用 `LUNA_MOONCAKE` 发布，最后创建对应 GitHub release。"

#: manual/verification.md:48
msgid "CI runs on pull requests and pushes to `main`. It repeats all-target builds and checks, default/JavaScript/native tests, interface snapshot validation, and formatting. A passing CI run is repository evidence, not a numerical conformance claim for any concrete backend."
msgstr "CI 会在 pull request 和 push 到 `main` 时运行，并重复 all-target build/check、 default/JavaScript/native tests、interface snapshot 验证和 formatting。通过 CI 是仓库证据，并不构成任何具体后端的数值 conformance 声明。"

